{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act54side", "eventName": "月行水上", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "SR-6", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "月蚀", "storyInfo": "结城理等人循着气息追踪到目标地点，竟是殡仪堂。然而强大的怪物无影无踪，众人只见到了与裘里奥爆发剧烈争吵、被裘里奥道破心事后郁悒不已、失魂落魄的吉阿达……", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g10_gate_night", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$darkness_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是这里……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3"}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#5$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是，这里并没有怪物的踪迹。强大的怪物，普通的怪物，都没有。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#5$2"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们追踪到一半的时候，怪物的气息就开始变得断断续续……现在，已经完全感知不到了。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#11$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但在这个过程中，怪物的位置并没有发生过变化……应该就是这附近没错。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#11$2"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……这个时间的殡仪堂，还有人在吗……", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$2"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "确认一下，怪物该不会是躲进了殡仪堂里吧？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（摇头）只是躲进建筑物内部的话，我不会感知不到的，何况是那么强烈的气息……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真奇怪……难道已经被消灭了吗？在我们之外，还有能消灭怪物的人？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不太可能……之前从来没有发生过这种情况。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "根据之前所有调查的情况来看，现在在拉特兰城里，应该只有我们能够消灭怪物……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么强烈的反应，为什么就消失了……？", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#9$2"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "殡仪堂附近比其他街区要冷清不少，静夜中的脚步声格外清晰。"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "熟悉的身影从建筑的阴影中走了出来，看见结城理等人，愣住一秒，匆匆熄灭了手中的烟卷。"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#12$1", "focus": "m", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们在这里干什么？这个时间来殡仪堂……还带着武器？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#12$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃……那个……我们刚刚在靶场训练！回宿舍的路上，想起有东西落在这里了……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$2"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "训练到这么晚？虽然宿舍大概没有宵禁，但玩得太晚了也不好。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那个……明天是休息日嘛，就稍微……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐呢，加班到这么晚吗……？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐有看到什么遗落的物品吗？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊……不知道。你们要是掉了东西就去找吧。侧门开着，自便。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$3"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4220_kormr_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "汪嗷……", "name": "虎狼丸"}, "figure_art": "avg_4220_kormr_1#7$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然不太可能……吉阿达小姐，你在附近，有看到奇怪的东西吗？或者，听到异常的响声……之类的？", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$2"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……也可能有，我没注意到。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐，刚才在做什么呢？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……做我最近每天都在做的事——和裘里奥吵架。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#7$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还是白天没决定的那个问题……？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$3"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，这次是他赢了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他说得没错……我是在利用这场葬礼。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g6_funeralhome", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "amount": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达，我不明白。之前的争执……你觉得我的想法很难接受，我能想象。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但今天，关于遗容……你在顾虑什么？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就因为“葬礼上应当悲伤”吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你之前好像说，不想和我“畅想拉特兰的未来”，重点是“不想畅想”，还是“不想和我”？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实你就是想改变我们，改变拉特兰，是吗？至少是改变拉特兰的葬礼风俗、追思方式。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……如果我说是呢。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一场葬礼当然不会有那么大作用，但这是一个开始……至少我要开始。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……吉阿达，你好像一位革新家啊。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是工作而已。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是，你要把这场葬礼变成……你的一场试验，或者宣告吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实所有这些事，我们争论的事，说到底都应该看死者的意愿，对不对？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是因为死者已经无法说出她的想法了，我们这些人才……不得不越俎代庖。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为可怜的姨妈死去了，甚至没有一位能为她操办葬礼的家人。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只有我这个不成器的、根本没有血缘关系的远房外甥。只有你，安魂殡仪堂的一位葬礼经纪。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……没错，死者已逝，没有人能僭称自己代表了死者的真意。我不能，难道你可以？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谁都不能。别装作你没有对这场葬礼寄托什么，你和我，都是在用这场葬礼追求自己想要的东西——", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#6$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……吉阿达，你忘记了……不，是你一直在回避——姨妈的遗嘱。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#8$1"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不论这份遗嘱有多老旧，但它就是姨妈本人留下的、最直接的意愿。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#8$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她想要一场派对，她想要有人在她的葬礼上玩得开心。至少在她走进公证所、登记这条遗嘱的那一天，她是这样想的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你根本不了解死者，你甚至不记得她的样子，别说得像你亲眼见到她立下遗嘱一样。已经过去二十年了……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不愿意承认这条遗嘱代表了维韦塔的意愿，真的是因为它太陈旧了，还是因为它对你的“愿景”不利？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#8$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你说我不了解姨妈，好，我承认。公平地说，对她而言我基本就是个陌生人了。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是吉阿达小姐，你呢？在她去世之前，你见过她，和她说过哪怕一句话吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "刚才那个问题，不是在指控，我是真的想问……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——吉阿达，你要把维韦塔的葬礼变成你的一场试验或者宣告吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g10_gate_night", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他说得没错。我一直试图回避那条遗嘱，把它当成死者年轻时的玩笑……不是因为它陈旧或者荒唐，而是因为它对我不利。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$2"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实在遗物里，我听到一首……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没什么。再继续找借口就有点难看了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然裘里奥经常看不懂别人的表情，听不懂别人的心情，但他真的很聪明，他说得完全没错。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我就是想改变这里，为什么我不能呢？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也是……拉特兰人。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道，从小就知道，拉特兰是萨科塔的圣城。当然了，每个黎博利都知道，所以在不知道多少代人之前，黎博利才会来到这里……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不正是为了学习天使的生活？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#7$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一直以来都是如此……所以我们分享了圣城的和平、繁盛和幸福。圣城如此赐福于黎博利。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#7$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是未来呢，谁还会赐福给我们？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们见到了现在的拉特兰，你们喜欢这个地方吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不，算了，不要告诉我。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果是去年春天，你们来到这里，我不知道这座城市在你们眼中会不会更可爱一点。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但现在……它成了这样，到处都是像我和裘里奥一样不知所措的人。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不该做些什么吗……我想要做些什么……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果我也能改变这里，是不是才能证明，这里也是我的家？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "77_i10", "xScale": 1.3, "yScale": 1.3, "y": 200.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleFrom": 1.3, "yScaleFrom": 1.3, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "xTo": 0.0, "yFrom": 200.0, "yTo": 0.0, "duration": 40.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "像是意识到失言，吉阿达低下了头，摆了摆手，转身离开了。她没有回到殡仪堂，走向了街道的另一头。"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没人还记得那个“遗落了东西”的借口。黎博利的脚步很轻，在阒然无声的夜里像露水跌落的涟漪，倏忽消散。"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "风花看着吉阿达的背影，“只要把话说开，那两人应该就能和好”的想法，也和渐远的跫音一样散落得无声无息。"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她甚至开始疑惑，如果他们真的来得早一点，来到一个心声通传的拉特兰，就不会在这里见到寂寞的人吗？"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也许她是知道答案的。"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "77_i10", "xScale": 1.0, "yScale": 1.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "残月淡薄的光洒落在洁白的城市，这里以幸福称誉于大地。"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夜雾轻柔地浮起，隐去了黎博利的身影。"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}